    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Pleasantly situated on the doorstep of the quaint and picturesque village of Termonfeckin, and affording sweeping views over Seapoint Golf Course & the Irish Sea, we are delighted to announce the sale of No 8. The Links. This 4 bedroom dormer bungalow is set within a small and exclusive residential development and boasts well planned living accommodation throughout. The property offers an abundance of natural light flowing through the home mainly due to its favourable west facing rear aspect & double height ceilings in the dining area. Termonfeckin is a small rural village situated approx. 10 minutes drive from Drogheda Town and c.20 minutes drive from the M1 motorway. Viewing Is Highly Recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\nLiving Room\r\nKitchen / Dining\r\nUtility Room\r\nBedroom 3\r\nBedroom 4\r\nGuest WC/Shower \r\nStorage\r\n\r\n1st floor\r\nBedroom 1\r\nEn Suite\r\nWalk-In-Wardrobe\r\nBedroom 2\r\nEn Suite"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "4 Bedroom Detached Dormer House\r\nBuilt C. 1998\r\nRear Extension – C. 10 Years Ago\r\nMcKevitt King Architecturally Designed\r\nPeter McAuley Designed Kitchen\r\nOverlooking Seapoint Golf Course\r\nO-F-C-H – High Efficiency Boiler\r\nZoned Heating Controls\r\n150 Meters from Golf Clubhouse/Pro Shop\r\n200 Meters to the Beach\r\nWood Burning Stove\r\nPVC Triple Glazing Throughout\r\nSteel Tech Garden Shed\r\nStoned Driveway\r\nAmple Parking \r\nFront Security Gates\r\nMature Planting & Landscaping\r\nPaved Rear Patio Seating Area\r\nWest Facing Rear Orientation\r\nFully Alarmed"
      },
      {
